InputNext Core and Effects SDK headers

The canonical InputNext Core and Effects ABI headers are included under
third_party/inputnext/include. Their paths and SHA-256 hashes are recorded in
third_party/inputnext/manifest.json. Source references are informational;
third_party/inputnext/UPSTREAM.md describes the source and update procedure.
The applicable MIT license is included at third_party/inputnext/LICENSE.

Optional Skyrim SE/AE native plugin

The independent project adapters/skyrim_se links CommonLibSSE-NG and other
dependencies. Its exact license texts, source pins and binary distribution
requirements are in adapters/skyrim_se/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.
The runtime-client library itself has no dependency on CommonLibSSE-NG.

Optional Skyrim Classic/LE native plugin

The independent project adapters/skyrim_le uses selected SKSE 1.7.3 support
sources. Source terms, preparation, and private patches are described in
adapters/skyrim_le/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES and adapters/skyrim_le/cmake/SKSE-PATCHES.md.

Optional Fallout 4 native plugin

The independent project adapters/fallout4 links CommonLibF4, commonlib-shared,
and spdlog. Source pins, license texts, and distribution requirements are in
adapters/fallout4/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.
